.TH KEY_DOWN 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
key_down \- True while the key is held
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqinput.h\(dq
.BI "bool key_down(const Input *in, Key k);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
True while the key is held. Use for continuous actions: walking, holding a charge, scrolling. Because it is true every frame the key stays down, never use it for "open the menu" style reactions; that is key_pressed().
.PP
This is a static inline function; it is defined in the header.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true if in\->keys[k] is set this frame.
.SH MODULE
input (src/engine/input/input.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR key_pressed (3),
.BR key_released (3),
.BR action_down (3),
.BR gge\-input (7),
